  "steps": [
    "Stir the taco seasoning into the refried beans in a medium bowl until evenly mixed. Spread in an even layer over the bottom of a large serving platter or a 9x13 in dish.",
    "In another bowl, beat the softened cream cheese and sour cream with a hand mixer or spoon until smooth, then spread over the beans.",
    "Spread the salsa over the cream layer. Scatter the lettuce, tomato, green pepper, and green onions over the salsa.",
    "Top with the cheddar and finish with the olives. Serve with tortilla chips, or cover and refrigerate up to a few hours until serving."
